/* Context budget: what each file costs the agent's context. The window bar has the instructions first in grey, then each
   file in a step of the accent, as wide as its share; the same step marks the file's row. Each part is drawn across the
   whole bar and clipped to its stretch (--dm-a to --dm-b, in percent), so as a share grows the parts slide with a clip and the
   bar is never laid out again. A file too big to read whole is hatched, and says how much of it the agent keeps */
.atx-ctx{padding:var(--dm-s-3);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--dm-s-3)}
.atx-ctx-h{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:var(--dm-s-3)}
